---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
---
<Site title="A good fit for your next build" description="Shopify storefronts, WordPress landing pages and ongoing funnel support. See how Marv can help with your next project." active="services">
<section class="wrap page-intro service-intro"><p class="section-context">The work I do</p><h1>From the first page<br>to the finer details.</h1><p>Practical help for brands and agencies that need a thoughtful build and someone to see it through.</p></section>
<section class="wrap service-offerings"><article><div><h2>Storefronts<br>with character.</h2></div><div><p>Your products have a story. The store should make it easy to discover, browse and choose them.</p><ul><li>Shopify storefront and collection setup</li><li>Product landing pages and advertorials</li><li>Content updates and campaign pages</li></ul><a href="/work/orias/" class="text-link">See ORIAS Essentials</a></div></article><article><div><span class="service-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h2>One page.<br>A clear next step.</h2></div><div><p>A focused place for your campaign, product or offer, with the right information in the right order.</p><ul><li>WordPress and Elementor page builds</li><li>Responsive layouts from your design and copy</li><li>Page review and launch preparation</li></ul><a href="/work/zenith/" class="text-link">See the Zenith build</a></div></article><article><div><h2>Support beyond<br>the launch.</h2></div><div><p>Offers change. Content evolves. I help keep the pages and connected flows moving with your business.</p><ul><li>GoHighLevel booking and lead-capture support</li><li>Funnelish and Shopify updates</li><li>Product content, translations and QA</li></ul><a href="/work/vendrato/" class="text-link">Explore funnel support</a></div></article></section>
<section class="process-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>A straightforward<br>way to work together.</h2><p>No guessing where things stand.</p></div><ol class="process-list"><li><h3>Get the brief right.</h3><p>We agree on the scope, platform, design, copy and access before the build starts.</p></li><li><h3>Build, then review.</h3><p>I put the page together, check the layout across screen sizes and share it for feedback.</p></li><li><h3>Finish the details.</h3><p>We work through the agreed revisions and review the links, content and final page before handover.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="wrap section faq"><h2>Before we start.</h2><div><details><summary>How quickly can a page be built?</summary><p>A typical page takes 1–2 days depending on complexity, once design, copy, scope and access are ready. Larger storefronts need a separate timeline.</p></details><details><summary>Can you work with our agency?</summary><p>Yes. I can help with individual builds and ongoing page updates. My working availability is 9 am–5 pm Australian hours, with the specific time zone agreed with your team.</p></details><details><summary>What should I send with an enquiry?</summary><p>The platform, the page or site scope, any existing designs and copy, and your target date. A link to your current site is helpful too.</p></details></div></section><ContactBand/></Site>
